# PROJECT: IMovies — Full-Stack Movie Ticket Booking & Cinema Management System

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, MERN stack developer, database architect, and UI/UX designer.

Your task is to design and develop a complete, functional, secure, and responsive web application named "IMovies".

The application must provide an end-to-end cinema ticket booking experience for customers and a comprehensive cinema management system for administrators.

Build this as a real software product with a consistent visual identity, practical features, clean architecture, meaningful user interactions, and reliable backend functionality.

The application should feel thoughtfully designed by a developer who understands real cinema booking workflows.

Do not create a generic AI-generated dashboard, a static website, or a frontend-only prototype.

Every major feature must connect to the appropriate backend API and database operation.

IMPORTANT: I am a student developing this project for academic evaluation and my portfolio. Keep the architecture professional but understandable enough that I can explain the code, database design, authentication, booking workflow, and important technical decisions during a project demonstration or viva.

