# 2. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Build a full-stack cinema booking platform where customers can:

- Register and log in securely.
- Browse currently running and upcoming movies.
- Search and filter movies.
- View movie information and trailers.
- Find cinemas and available showtimes.
- Select seats from an interactive cinema seating layout.
- See seat availability update in real time.
- Book tickets and complete payment through a supported payment integration.
- Receive booking confirmation and a digital ticket.
- View booking history.
- Cancel eligible bookings according to the cancellation policy.
- Receive relevant booking notifications.

Administrators should be able to manage movies, cinemas, screens, shows, seating layouts, bookings, and other operational information through a protected administration panel.

The system must prevent double booking and handle concurrent seat-selection attempts correctly.

