# 11. BOOKING CANCELLATION

Implement configurable cancellation rules.

The cancellation workflow must:
- Verify booking ownership.
- Check whether cancellation is permitted.
- Prevent repeated cancellation.
- Record cancellation timestamps and reasons where applicable.
- Calculate eligible refunds according to the configured policy.
- Update booking and seat inventory consistently.
- Initiate a refund through the payment provider when supported.
- Track refund status independently from cancellation status.
- Handle refund failures and retries.
- Notify the customer of the result.

Do not immediately mark a refund as completed merely because a refund request was submitted.

Document the default cancellation policy and make it configurable.

